! Mechanism for gasoline surrogate fuels developed at King Abdullah University of Science and Technology (KAUST), Saudi Arabia to account for the formation of PAHs up to coronene
! Base mechanism for chemistry upto benzene: C. Vovelle et al, Modelling of Aromatics and Soot Formation from Large Fuel Molecules, Proc. Combust. Inst., 32, 2008
! Rates for some of the reactions are updated, and many new PAH reactions are added. The keyword "KAUST" is added in the comments area, wherever changes are made.
!
! n-decane, n-heptane, iso-octane, toluene mechanism
!
ELEMENTS
C  H  O  N  AR
END
!
SPECIES
!
! inert
!
N2 AR 
!
! H2/O2
! ------------------------------------------------------------
H       H2      O       OH      H2O     O2      HO2     H2O2
!
! C1
! ------------------------------------------------------------
C       CH      CH2     CH2*    CH3     CH4     CO      HCO     
CH2O    CH2OH   CH3O    CH3OH   CO2	
!
! C2
! ------------------------------------------------------------
C2H     C2H2    C2H3    C2H4    C2H5    C2H6	
HCCO    CH2CO   HCCOH   C2O     C2H3O   CH3CHO  
!
! C3
! ------------------------------------------------------------
