A2R5C2H2 A2R5C2H A2R5C2HY A3R5 A3R5X A4R5 FLTN 
OC6H4O C9H7 C9H6O C9H8 O-C6H4 C4H4O C8H2
OA1CH3 HOA1CH3 A1CH2OH C5H4CH2
